sequenceDiagram
    autonumber off
    actor User
    participant Pages as Web pages<br/>login, reset, header menu
    participant Next as Next.js server<br/>middleware.ts
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth
    participant Mail as Email inbox

    Note over User,Mail: Covers US 5.0.2 and US 5.0.4. Password reset is not in the code today.<br/>"(proposed)" = the step is not in the code today.

    Note over User,Mail: US 5.0.2 Reset a forgotten password (no Admin step, AT 4)
    User->>Pages: Select Forgot password on /login (proposed)
    User->>Pages: Enter email
    Pages->>Auth: requestPasswordReset(email) in services/auth.ts<br/>calls resetPasswordForEmail (proposed)
    Auth->>Mail: Send reset link and one-time code (AT 1)
    Pages-->>User: Show "If the account exists, we sent an email"
    User->>Pages: Open link. Reset page /auth/reset opens<br/>(/auth/* is already public in middleware.ts) (proposed)
    User->>Pages: Enter code from the email
    Pages->>Auth: verifyResetCode(email, code) in services/auth.ts<br/>calls verifyOtp with type recovery (proposed)
    alt Code is wrong or expired (AT 2)
        Auth-->>Pages: Error
        Pages-->>User: Show error. Offer a new email
    else Code is correct
        Auth-->>Pages: Recovery session
        User->>Pages: Enter new password
        Pages->>Auth: updatePassword(new password) in services/auth.ts<br/>calls updateUser (proposed)
        alt Password does not meet the rules
            Auth-->>Pages: Error
            Pages-->>User: Show password rules
        else Password is accepted
            Auth-->>Pages: Password changed. Old password stops working
            Pages-->>User: Go to /login. Sign in with new password (AT 3)
        end
    end

    Note over User,Mail: US 5.0.4 Sign out properly
    User->>Pages: Select Logout in HeaderDropdown or AdminNavBar,<br/>or Sign Out on the "Awaiting Admin Approval" screen (AT 3)
    Pages->>Pages: useSignOut() in hooks/useSignOut.ts calls<br/>logout() in services/auth.ts (exists)
    Pages->>Auth: supabase.auth.signOut() in the browser (exists)
    alt Sign-out fails
        Auth-->>Pages: Error. logout() returns {success: false, error}
        Pages-->>User: Stay on the page. Show "Sign-out failed.<br/>Check your connection and try again." (exists)
    else Sign-out succeeds
        Auth-->>Pages: Session ended. Browser auth cookies cleared
        Pages-->>User: Go to /login (exists)
    end
    User->>Pages: Press Back, or open the app again (AT 1, AT 2)
    Pages->>Next: Request a signed-in page. Page is not cached<br/>(Cache-Control no-store, proposed)
    Next->>Auth: getUser() in middleware.ts (exists)
    Auth-->>Next: No user
    Next-->>User: Redirect to /login (exists)

    Note over Pages,Auth: Sign-out runs in the browser. There is no /auth/signout route as of October 11, 2026.<br/>SignedOutGuard sends a page that the Back button restores to /login (AT 2).<br/>A server-side sign-out route and Cache-Control no-store are still proposed.
